From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 14:43:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Answer replies from the dashboard

The Replies tab gets a Reply button. It opens the whole conversation with
that contact, read live from the account that emailed them (All Mail over
IMAP), and a box that sends the answer from the same account over SMTP,
threaded onto their latest message (Re: subject, In-Reply-To, References)
with their message quoted underneath. Answering stops the contact's
automatic follow-ups; dry-run mode logs it without sending.

The inbox check now also records a further message from someone who
already replied ("replied again": badge, log, Replies list) without
counting a second reply, and matches replies to answers sent from the
dashboard by their Message-ID.

